B.Om=A.a(s(["State management preference: Riverpod first, then Provider. I can work with Bloc when needed, but I avoid GetX.","Routing: Usually native Navigator. Occasionally I build custom navigation systems when the project calls for it.","I'm a quick learner, so if you have any project with a package, state management solution, or database I haven't worked with before, it's totally okay\u2014as long as it's developed with Dart, I can handle it","I'm not a multitasker. I prefer focusing deeply on one task at a time to deliver clean, maintainable, high-quality work.","I enjoy writing things from scratch (UI components, state logic, etc.) when time allows \u2014 it helps me deeply understand the code. When deadlines are tight, delivery quality still comes first.","Development setup: Windows + DELL laptop, VS Code as my main editor. Android Studio only for Gradle headaches or native code.","I'm usually a solo developer, but I really enjoy collaborating with friendly, respectful teams.","I write simple, readable, and easy-to-understand code\u2014even for those who aren't developers","I use AI tools for assistance and idea generation, but I never rely on them to write code I don't fully understand.","I'm in love with helping others (developers or people). I believe that asking for help is not giving up\u2014it's refusing to give up",'Trying so hard so when someone sees a piece of my code, they don\'t say "What the f*** is this"',"I'm very clever at making bugs, but I guarantee I'm just as clever at fixing them","I'm an OCD person, if I miss something in the code, my OCD won't let me sleep in peace","If you want to work with me, you'll get the full package: Developer, Friend, Consultant and Caring teammate.","I'm there for you 24/7 (Seriously, DM me at 3 AM if you're stuck)"]),t.s)
